; kilim.web (design section 13): the Jv bindings for the
; Web APIs that Brr 0.0.9 does not have. It depends on Brr only. Each binding
; is one unit with its .mli. The library has no main module: dune makes the
; alias module, thus a program links only the units that it uses. No module
; reads a global at initialization, thus node can load the library. The
; library uses none of Printf, Format, Scanf, Str, Hashtbl, Random, Fun or
; Printexc (test/link). windtrap runs only native code, thus
; test/dom/guards.txt lists the guards of this library with their tests.

(library
 (name kilim_web)
 (public_name kilim.web)
 (libraries brr))
